Create a professional editing interface with:
- Media import for supported video, image and audio files.
- Video preview player with play, pause, seek and volume controls.
- Multi-track timeline for video, audio, images, titles and subtitles.
- Trim, split, merge, reorder and delete clips.
- Crop, rotate, resize, speed adjustment and volume control.
- Text overlays, animated titles, transitions and filters.
- Undo and redo, zoom timeline and autosave.
- Keyboard shortcuts and project recovery.
